      "Some properties face a debris load that standard micro-mesh simply wasn't designed around — a yard ringed by mature pines dropping needles year-round, combined with deciduous trees adding leaves and seed pods each season. Gutter Glove's Ultra line exists for exactly that scenario, using a noticeably tighter mesh weave than the standard micro-mesh products on this list, engineered specifically to stop pine needles, which are thin enough to occasionally slip through standard mesh openings over time as they wear slightly larger. In our mixed-debris test environment — a yard with both mature pines and oak trees — the Ultra mesh kept the gutter channel visibly cleaner than the standard Raptor and Amerimax products over an equivalent test period, with essentially no needle accumulation inside the gutter itself. The frame is also reinforced compared to standard-gauge competitors, which showed in our snow-load simulation testing where it maintained its shape and mounting integrity under weight that caused slight sagging in a lighter-gauge guard. All of that engineering comes at the highest price point on this list, and for a property without heavy pine cover, it's genuinely more capability than most homeowners need — the standard Raptor or Amerimax mesh handles typical leaf debris just as well for considerably less money. But for a pine-heavy property that's been fighting genuinely difficult clogs, it's worth the premium.",
  },
];

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      itemListElement: [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 1,
          name: "Home",
          item: "https://www.allmetalbrake.com/",
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 2,
          name: "Best Lists",
          item: "https://www.allmetalbrake.com/best-of/",
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 3,
          name: "Best Gutter Guards",
          item: "https://www.allmetalbrake.com/best-gutter-guards/",
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
