          We installed 11+ gutter guard systems on real homes and ran them through simulated leaf, pine needle, and heavy rain seasons. Micro-mesh, reverse curve, foam, and brush — only 7 earned a spot. Here's what actually keeps gutters clear.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
