                Yes, when the right type is matched to your property's debris and correctly installed. Micro-mesh guards block the vast majority of leaves, needles, and debris while passing water through effectively. No gutter guard eliminates maintenance entirely, but a well-chosen system reduces cleaning from twice a year to roughly once a year or less.
